     "text": "THEIR GOAL."
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Their goal is simple: to make a real difference in people’s lives, with products that genuinely help. From better sleep, to stress relief, pain management, sharper focus, and overall happiness, each product is crafted with care. Treeworks products use full spectrum extracts, organic ingredients, supportive herbal supplements, science-backed formulas, and sustainable packaging. Rooted in Massachusetts, and now in Connecticut &amp; New Jersey, we’re proud to share our creations with our growing community.</p>"
    },
